  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Use of Revenue Consultants in the OfD Mozambique Programme 2022-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design and strengthen the revenue management component of the OfD country programme in Mozambique through cooperation with the Ministry of Economy and Finance (MEF) for the remaining period of the current four-year OfD Mozamibque country programme, (until December 31st, 2023).</narrative>
  </description>
